    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bunker's last expedition never returned and it's up to just you and three other friends. Fix the bunker's power, reestablish communication systems, and work together survive another night! Explore  your bunker as you solve puzzles, avoid monsters, find secrets, and complete objectives! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face horrors both seen and unseen and it will take careful planning and execution to restore the bunker without becoming yet another statistic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about what happened to the world, your bunker, and those around you as you explore the dimly lit and ill-fated surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Be scared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Multiple endings!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bunker's last expedition never returned and it's up to just you and three other friends. Fix the bunker's power, reestablish communication systems, and work together survive another night! Explore  your bunker as you solve puzzles, avoid monsters, find secrets, and complete objectives! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will face horrors both seen and unseen and it will take careful planning and execution to restore the bunker without becoming yet another statistic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about what happened to the world, your bunker, and those around you as you explore the dimly lit and ill-fated surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Be scared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Multiple endings!</p>",
